    icon only ever shows the middle 72dp of its 108dp layer - unscaled, the mask would cut the
    wrench and the screwdriver clean off. The scale below lands the art at the same size the
    colour foreground (mipmap/app_icon_foreground) draws it, ~43% of the canvas, centred, so the
    themed icon is the same size on the home screen as the normal one.
